VALUES ('Digital Changing Ireland: now with greater interactive features', 'digital-changing-ireland-now-with-greater-interactive-features', '<div><a href="https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-Cd9MABivYqA/UVRFwJbuSWI/AAAAAAAAAsw/2OdesysnIDQ/s1600/issuu.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" border="0" height="179" src="https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-Cd9MABivYqA/UVRFwJbuSWI/AAAAAAAAAsw/2OdesysnIDQ/s320/issuu.jpg" width="320" /></a></div>
<p>You can now enjoy the digital edition of Changing Ireland with greater interaction and ease of access. </p>
<p>&nbsp;We have upgraded our issuu.com account to include every issue of Changing Ireland and readers can now preview each edition&#8217;s content before clicking to read. Readers can now also share and read individual stories by clicking &#8216;articles&#8217; underneath each edition.</p>
<p>Website links in our articles have also been updated and can be accessed with one click. Plus, we have tagged each edition with relevant words related to the stories contained within. Enjoy!</p>', 'You can now enjoy the digital edition of Changing Ireland with greater interaction and ease of access. We have upgraded our issuu.com account to include every issue of Changing Ireland and readers can now preview each edition’s content before clicking to read. Readers can now also share and read individual stories by clicking ‘articles’ underneath', '', '', '[{"slug":"uncategorized","title":"Uncategorized"}]', '[]', '', 174, 1, '2013-03-28T13:34:00Z', '2019-09-13T10:45:45Z', '2013-03-28T13:34:00Z')
