</div>', 'It’s out! Packed with news & features, the Winter 2012 edition of ‘Changing Ireland’ has reached many thousands of readers around the country by post, is in Easons and you can flick through as easily as the paper version at https://issuu.com/changingireland/docs/changing_ireland-issue_41__winter_2012 LEAD ST ORYPoliticans Promise The Sun, Moon & Stars, but Martin delivers!COLLECTIVE ACTIONOlder People Speaking', '', '', '[{"slug":"uncategorized","title":"Uncategorized"}]', '[]', '', 176, 1, '2012-12-14T15:37:00Z', '2019-09-12T15:42:24Z', '2012-12-14T15:37:00Z')
